          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುಂದೂಡು (mundūḍu) is native Dravidian: mundu, \"ahead, in front\" (DEDR 5020), and dūḍu, \"to push, shove\" (DEDR 3380): \"to push ahead\"."
